<title>PHILIPPINES: SM Prime buys land in southern Philippines.</title>
<headline>SM Prime buys land in southern Philippines.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>SM Prime Holdings Inc said on Friday it had acquired land in a commercial area in Cagayan de Oro City in southern Philippines.</p>
<p>It said the purchase of land was in relation to the establishment of a mall. It did not disclose the terms of the acquisition.</p>
<p>SM Prime has five shopping malls in the country, four of which are located in Metro Manila and one in Cebu, central Philippines. It plans to open two new malls every year.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
